{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Pr\u00e9dispos\u00e9e aux accidents en \u00c9gypte", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "La visite du Caire", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 9, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant d\u00e9crit en fran\u00e7ais \u00e9crit et oral des pi\u00e8ces, des maisons et des objets des immeubles dans des situations sociales quotidiennes ou de travail.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "dentifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "frn5le09ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "V\u00e9rifier la bonne compr\u00e9hension ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Pour v\u00e9rifier si on a bien compris le message, on peut employer certaines phrases et locutions adverbiales. On les utilise aussi pour faire r\u00e9p\u00e9ter une information :", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Que voulez-vous dire par l\u00e0 ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "\u00c7a veut dire que des pauvres se sont install\u00e9s dans cet endroit. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Qu'est-ce que vous disiez ? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<li><span class=\"italic\">\u00c7a/cela veut dire ? </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li><span class=\"italic\">C'est-\u00e0-dire (que)</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li><span class=\"italic\">Autrement dit</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li><span class=\"italic\">En d'autres termes</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li><span class=\"italic\">Que voulez-vous dire ?</span> ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "La pr\u00e9position \u00e0 pour les villes", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "On utilise la pr\u00e9position <span class=\"strong\"> \u00e0</span> avant le nom des villes. </br>  Exemple : <span class=\"italic\"></br> \u00e0 Qu\u00e9bec (la ville de Qu\u00e9bec), \u00e0 Paris, \u00e0 New York, \u00e0 Moscou, etc.</span> </br></br>  La plupart des noms des villes n'ont pas d'article. Cependant, il existe des villes qui comportent un article d\u00e9fini f\u00e9minin ou masculin, dans leur nom. Dans ce cas, il faut faire la contraction habituelle de <span class=\"strong\"> \u00e0 + le</span>. </br>Exemple : </br><span class=\"italic\">Le Caire, Le Mans, La Mec, La Haye, Le Havre, </span>etc.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Elle avait habit\u00e9 au Caire pendant 2 ans avant de d\u00e9m\u00e9nager \u00e0 Paris.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Elle va \u00e0 La Haye assister \u00e0 la cour internationale de justice. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la gemme", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une mati\u00e8re min\u00e9rale (pierre fine, pierre pr\u00e9cieuse) ou organique (perle, ambre) utilis\u00e9e en bijouterie ou joaillerie", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : \u00c7a veut dire les gemmes ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous employez pour parler du bazar du Caire.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le souk", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un bazar ; un march\u00e9 couvert des pays d'islam", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le Khan el-Khalili, un souk ancien est une attraction touristique au Caire. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la pierre pr\u00e9cieuse", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une pierre qui a une grande valeur en raison de sa raret\u00e9, de son \u00e9clat, ou de sa duret\u00e9", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ici on peut acheter des pierres fines et pr\u00e9cieuses.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "remonter \u00e0", "type": "name"}, {"content": "dater de", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La structure et la grande partie des \u00e9difices du bazar remontent au XIVe si\u00e8cle.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le cimeti\u00e8re", "type": "name"}, {"content": "l'endroit o\u00f9 l'on enterre les morts", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Voici le cimeti\u00e8re du nord. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la lessive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un produit destin\u00e9 aux lavages et aux nettoyages m\u00e9nagers", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il faut acheter de la lessive pour nettoyer la maison.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "D\u00e9crivez un cimeti\u00e8re qui se trouve dans votre ville ou pr\u00e8s de votre ville.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez 7 \u00e0 10 phrases exprimant l'endroit o\u00f9 il est situ\u00e9.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "D\u00e9crivez des us et coutumes de votre pays relativement aux cimeti\u00e8res.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Partagez vos phrases avec votre camarade.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "Je d\u00e9cris des lieux d'int\u00e9r\u00eat d'une ville.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9change sur les informations que j'ai trouv\u00e9es avec un camarade.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "frn5le09ob07re2img06.jpg", "audiosrc": "frn5le09ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "frn5le09ob07re2img06.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "frn5le09ob07re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Le guide</span> : Voici le Khan el-Khalili, le grand souk du Caire. La structure et la grande partie des \u00e9difices du bazar remontent au XIVe si\u00e8cle, l'\u00e9poque mamlouk. Ce qui est fascinant c'est que les gens continuent de se rendre au bazar pour acheter tout, de la lessive aux pierres fines et pr\u00e9cieuses.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : \u00c7a veut dire les gemmes ?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Le guide</span> : Oui, tout \u00e0 fait. Je vous propose d'aller dans un salon de th\u00e9 traditionnel. Ensuite, de visiter la mosqu\u00e9e."}, {"time": "26500", "image": "frn5le09ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Alors, vous avez dit qu'il faut enlever les chaussures ? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Le guide</span> : Oui, c'est \u00e7a. On vient de voir la coupole \u00e0 l'ext\u00e9rieur. Maintenant, observez les arabesques \u00e0 l'int\u00e9rieur avec tous ces motifs floraux. Regardez aussi la marqueterie au plafond et les verres color\u00e9s aux fen\u00eatres. C'est un bon endroit pour s'asseoir et se d\u00e9tendre.</br><span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Magnifique !"}, {"time": "46000", "image": "frn5le09ob07re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Le guide</span> : Voici le cimeti\u00e8re nord. Les sultans mamlouks l'ont construit pour les morts, mais il y a aussi  les sans-abri qui sont venus partager l'espace.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Je ne comprends pas bien. Que voulez-vous dire par l\u00e0 ?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Le guide</span> : Je veux dire que des pauvres se sont install\u00e9s \u00e0 cet endroit. Ensuite, on leur a donn\u00e9 des services urbains comme l'\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 et la poste. Alors aujourd'hui, aussi bien les morts que les vivants occupent ce cimeti\u00e8re.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : C'est incroyable !"}]}}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux parler de voyages et des endroits autour du monde.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux v\u00e9rifier si j'ai bien compris.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux demander ou rapporter des informations sur des choses, des actions, des \u00e9v\u00e9nements et des personnes.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Pr\u00e9f\u00e9rez-vous visiter les grandes villes ou les petits villages pendant vos vacances&nbsp;? Pourquoi&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Quelles villes aimeriez-vous visiter&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Dans le grand souk du Caire&nbsp;!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1, "questions": []}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Qu'apprend Charlotte au sujet de la ville du <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">Caire</span> et son <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_1\">bazar</span> ?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content